<title>Decomposition Coverage Audit</title>


<div class=3D"page">

  <div class=3D"eyebrow">Decomposition Round =C2=B7 Coverage Audit</div>
  <h1>Does the RAG chapter cover what an FDE / Applied&nbsp;AI panel actual=
ly scores?</h1>
  <p class=3D"dek">A pattern-by-pattern check of your Chapter&nbsp;1 write-=
up against the universal decomposition rubric used across forward-deployed =
and applied-AI system-design rounds =E2=80=94 not just this one RAG scenari=
o.</p>

  <div class=3D"headline-row">
    <div class=3D"score-figure">
      <svg viewBox=3D"0 0 120 120">
